    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 2a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ geðence swiðe georne se ðe domes geweald áge hwæs he sylfe gyrrne, ðonne he ðus cweðe: "Et dimitte nobis debita nostra sicut et nos dimittimus."</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who has authority to give judgment shall consider very earnestly what he himself desires when he says thus: "and forgive us our trespasses as we forgive [them that trespass against us]."</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ geþence swyþe georne se ðe domes geweald áge, hwæs he sylf gyrne, þonne he þus cweðe: 'Et dimitte nobis debita nostra sicut et nos dimittimus.' (þæt is on Englisc: '⁊ forgyf us, Drihten, ure gyltas, swa we forgyfað þam ðe wið us agyltað').</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
